                                                "sense_id": "bbd5e39c-ded8-3076-8c72-1f812804630c",
                                                "text": "She then became a domestic and after a year was a sex offender for the first time. She had known the man for 2 years. Her sister discovered her relations with this man 8 months later and had her sent to the House of Good Shepherd."
