                                                "sense_id": "bbd5e39c-ded8-3076-8c72-1f812804630c",
                                                "text": "Epstein, the deceased financier, sex offender and friend to the rich and famous, has been at the heart of a sprawling conspiracy theory about child sex-trafficking and the global elite since he killed himself in jail six years ago — a suicide that was reaffirmed by the FBI this month."
